OL,3,GNEWSACorbyn-led Your Party opens Hull
OL,4,Abranch
OL,5,
OL,6,FA branch of the Jeremy Corbyn-led Your
OL,7,FParty has opened in Hull.
OL,9,FThe new left-wing political party was
OL,10,Ffounded by Corbyn and Zarah Sultana in
OL,11,F2025.
OL,13,FThe party said it had opened 50 local
OL,14,Fbranches. A further 50 are planned, it
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FGeorge McManus, chairman of the Hull
OL,18,Fand East Yorkshire branch, said there
OL,19,Fwas a "great turn out" and a "very
OL,20,Flively discussion" at the launch, which
OL,21,Fwas held at the Tiger's Lair Social
OL,22,FClub on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
